  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposed rear dormer in conjunction with the part first, part two storey rear extension would constitute an overly dominant and poorly designed addition, failing to appear subordinate to the host dwelling and harming the character and proportions of the existing property. As such, the development is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy D3 of The London Plan (2021) and Policy GR1 of Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
